{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"task-list","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Task List","description":"A checklist in the sidebar for each project: add tasks, tick them off, set a priority, turn a line of code into a task.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.1"},"categories":["Productivity"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","main":"extension.js","activationEvents":["onStartup"],"permissions":[],"contributes":{"commands":[{"command":"taskList.show","title":"Show Task List","category":"Task List"},{"command":"taskList.add","title":"Add Task...","category":"Task List"},{"command":"taskList.addSelection","title":"Add Selection or Line as Task","category":"Task List"},{"command":"taskList.pick","title":"Mark a Task as Done...","category":"Task List"},{"command":"taskList.clearDone","title":"Clear Done Tasks","category":"Task List"}],"viewsContainers":[{"id":"tasks","title":"Tasks","icon":"checklist"}],"views":[{"id":"taskList.page","name":"Tasks","container":"tasks","type":"html"}],"keybindings":[{"command":"taskList.add","key":"Ctrl+Alt+T"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"extension.js":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"// Task List: a checklist in the sidebar for each project. Add tasks, tick them off, set a priority, and turn a selected line into a task.\n\nconst KEY = 'tasks.v2';\nconst MAX = 500;\n\nconst clean = (t) => ({\n  id: String(t.id || Date.now().toString(36) + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 6)).slice(0, 40),\n  text: String(t.text || '').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim().slice(0, 300),\n  done: !!t.done,\n  prio: ['high', 'normal', 'low'].includes(t.prio) ? t.prio : 'normal',\n  at: t.at && typeof t.at === 'string' ? t.at.slice(0, 120) : '',\n  created: Number(t.created) || Date.now(),\n});\n\nconst RANK = { high: 0, normal: 1, low: 2 };\n/** Open tasks first (high priority first, then oldest), done tasks at the bottom. */\nfunction order(list) {\n  return [...list].sort((a, b) => Number(a.done) - Number(b.done) || RANK[a.prio] - RANK[b.prio] || a.created - b.created);\n}\nconst pending = (list) => list.filter((t) => !t.done).length;\n\nfunction page(list) {\n  return `<style>\n  body { font-family: var(--ui); margin: 0; }\n  form { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; } input[type=text] { flex: 1; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: var(--raised, transparent); color: var(--fg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px; font: 13px var(--ui); outline: none; } input[type=text]:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }\n  select, button { background: var(--raised, transparent); color: var(--fg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 5px; padding: 4px 8px; cursor: pointer; font: 12px var(--ui); } button:hover, select:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }\n  .t { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 5px 4px; border-radius: 5px; } .t:hover { background: var(--raised, rgba(128,128,128,.12)); }\n  .t input { margin-top: 3px; } .t .x { flex: 1; word-break: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; } .t.done .x { text-decoration: line-through; opacity: .5; }\n  .t small { display: block; color: var(--fg-dim); font-size: 11px; } .p { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 6px; flex: none; } .p.high { background: #ef4444; } .p.normal { background: #3b82f6; } .p.low { background: #9ca3af; }\n  .rm { opacity: 0; border: none; background: none; padding: 0 4px; color: var(--fg-dim); } .t:hover .rm { opacity: 1; }\n  .sum { color: var(--fg-dim); font-size: 12px; margin: 8px 0 4px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }\n</style>\n<form id=\"f\"><input type=\"text\" id=\"in\" placeholder=\"Add a task and press Enter\" autocomplete=\"off\"><select id=\"pr\"><option value=\"normal\">Normal</option><option value=\"high\">High</option><option value=\"low\">Low</option></select></form>\n<div class=\"sum\"><span id=\"sum\"></span><button id=\"clr\">Clear done</button></div>\n<div id=\"list\"></div>\n<script>\n  let items = ${JSON.stringify(list).replace(/</g, '\\\\u003c')};\n  const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n  const send = (m) => ferrumPanel.postMessage(m);\n  function render() {\n    const left = items.filter((t) => !t.done).length;\n    $('sum').textContent = items.length ? left + ' open, ' + (items.length - left) + ' done' : 'Nothing to do yet';\n    const box = $('list'); box.innerHTML = '';\n    for (const t of items) {\n      const d = document.createElement('div'); d.className = 't' + (t.done ? ' done' : '');\n      const c = document.createElement('input'); c.type = 'checkbox'; c.checked = t.done; c.onchange = () => send({ type: 'toggle', id: t.id });\n      const p = document.createElement('span'); p.className = 'p ' + t.prio; p.title = t.prio + ' priority';\n      p.onclick = () => send({ type: 'cycle', id: t.id }); p.style.cursor = 'pointer';\n      const x = document.createElement('div'); x.className = 'x'; x.textContent = t.text;\n      if (t.at) { const s = document.createElement('small'); s.textContent = t.at; x.appendChild(s); }\n      const r = document.createElement('button'); r.className = 'rm'; r.textContent = '✕'; r.title = 'Delete'; r.onclick = () => send({ type: 'remove', id: t.id });\n      d.append(c, p, x, r); box.appendChild(d);\n    }\n  }\n  $('f').onsubmit = (e) => { e.preventDefault(); const v = $('in').value.trim(); if (v) { send({ type: 'add', text: v, prio: $('pr').value }); $('in').value = ''; } };\n  $('clr').onclick = () => send({ type: 'clear' });\n  ferrumPanel.onMessage((m) => { if (m.type === 'list') { items = m.items; render(); } });\n  render();\n</script>`;\n}\n\nexports._test = { clean, order, pending };\n\nexports.activate = function (context) {\n  const project = () => ferrum.workspace.root || '(no folder)';\n  const reg = (id, fn) => context.subscriptions.push(ferrum.commands.register(id, fn));\n  let view = null;\n\n  const all = async () => (await ferrum.storage.get(KEY, {})) || {};\n  const load = async () => order(((await all())[project()] || []).map(clean).filter((t) => t.text));\n  async function save(list) {\n    const a = await all();\n    if (list.length) a[project()] = list.slice(0, MAX);\n    else delete a[project()];\n    await ferrum.storage.set(KEY, a);\n    await refresh(list);\n  }\n  async function refresh(list) {\n    const items = order(list || (await load()));\n    if (view) {\n      view.postMessage({ type: 'list', items });\n      view.setBadge(pending(items));\n    }\n    ferrum.window.setStatusBar('taskList.status', pending(items) ? { text: 'Tasks: ' + pending(items), tooltip: 'Open the Task List', command: 'taskList.show' } : { text: '' });\n  }\n  async function add(text, prio, at) {\n    const t = clean({ text, prio, at });\n    if (!t.text) return;\n    const list = await load();\n    if (list.length >= MAX) return ferrum.window.showMessage('The list is full (' + MAX + ' tasks). Clear the done ones first.', 'warn');\n    await save([...list, t]);\n  }\n  async function apply(m) {\n    const list = await load();\n    if (m.type === 'add') return add(m.text, m.prio);\n    if (m.type === 'toggle') return save(list.map((t) => (t.id === m.id ? { ...t, done: !t.done } : t)));\n    if (m.type === 'cycle') return save(list.map((t) => (t.id === m.id ? { ...t, prio: { normal: 'high', high: 'low', low: 'normal' }[t.prio] } : t)));\n    if (m.type === 'remove') return save(list.filter((t) => t.id !== m.id));\n    if (m.type === 'clear') return save(list.filter((t) => !t.done));\n  }\n\n  load().then((items) => {\n    view = ferrum.window.registerHtmlView('taskList.page', { html: page(items) });\n    context.subscriptions.push(view);\n    view.onMessage((m) => apply(m).catch((e) => ferrum.window.showMessage(e.message, 'error')));\n    view.setBadge(pending(items));\n    refresh(items);\n  });\n\n  reg('taskList.show', () => ferrum.commands.execute('view.ext.vyloxi.task-list:tasks'));\n  reg('taskList.add', async () => {\n    const text = await ferrum.window.showInputBox({ prompt: 'New task' });\n    if (text) await add(text, 'normal');\n  });\n  reg('taskList.addSelection', async () => {\n    const doc = await ferrum.editor.active();\n    if (!doc) return ferrum.window.showMessage('Open a file first.', 'warn');\n    const line = doc.selection.start.line;\n    const text = (doc.selectedText || (await ferrum.editor.getLine(line))).replace(/^\\s*(\\/\\/|#|--|\\*|-|\\/\\*)+\\s*(TODO|FIXME)?:?\\s*/i, '').trim();\n    if (!text) return ferrum.window.showMessage('Select a line of text, or put the cursor on one.', 'warn');\n    await add(text, 'normal', doc.name + ':' + (line + 1));\n    ferrum.window.showMessage('Added to the Task List.');\n  });\n  reg('taskList.clearDone', async () => save((await load()).filter((t) => !t.done)));\n  reg('taskList.pick', async () => {\n    const list = (await load()).filter((t) => !t.done);\n    if (!list.length) return ferrum.window.showMessage('No open tasks.');\n    const pick = await ferrum.window.showQuickPick(list.map((t) => ({ label: t.text, detail: t.at, description: t.prio, id: t.id })), { placeholder: 'Pick a task to mark as done' });\n    if (pick) await save((await load()).map((t) => (t.id === pick.id ? { ...t, done: true } : t)));\n  });\n};\n\nexports.deactivate = function () {};\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Task List\n\nA **Tasks** icon in the activity bar opens a checklist for the current project. Type a task and press Enter, tick the box when it is done, click the colored dot to change its priority (high, normal, low), and hover to delete. Open tasks are sorted by priority, done tasks sink to the bottom. The count of open tasks shows on the icon and in the status bar.\n\n**Add Selection or Line as Task** turns the selected text (or the current line, without its comment marker) into a task and remembers where it came from. **Mark a Task as Done...** does it from the keyboard.\n\nTasks are kept for each project folder in this extension's storage and come back next time. For tasks that live inside your code as comments, see *TODO Tree*.\n\nUses the **sidebar views** API. No permissions needed.\n"}}}